801|     * level is depth of the current node under consideration
802|     * list is the pointer to the root of the output tree
803|     * listParent is a pointer to the parent of output tree (within
804|       the included file) in case we need to add another level
805|     * last is a pointer to the last node added to the output tree
806|     * lastLevel is the depth of last (relative to the root)
